WEBVTT

00:07:56.889 --> 00:08:01.018
And those officials
should resource every community

00:08:01.018 --> 00:08:04.063
to develop a climate action plan

00:08:04.063 --> 00:08:08.400
that addresses neighborhood level
response and challenges

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:10.903
to extreme weather events.

00:08:12.988 --> 00:08:17.785
We've also developed strong,
strong policy agendas at the city,

00:08:17.826 --> 00:08:19.036
state and federal levels,

00:08:19.078 --> 00:08:22.706
based on community
perspectives, experience

00:08:22.748 --> 00:08:26.252
and the evolving transition
from a fossil fuel economy.

00:08:26.835 --> 00:08:32.550
And these are tactics that can be applied
within local contexts in any community.